@startuml
title MEDORA -- Clinical Note Version Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9FE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #183247
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2563A6
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  BorderColor #2563A6
  FontColor #183247
  FontSize 18
  ArrowColor #2563A6
}
[*] --> Draft : create note
Draft --> Draft : save changes
Draft --> Signed : sign [required fields valid and actor authorized]
Signed --> AmendmentDraft : request correction [reason supplied and authorized]
AmendmentDraft --> AmendmentDraft : save correction
AmendmentDraft --> AmendedVersionSigned : sign amendment [validation succeeds]
AmendmentDraft --> Signed : abandon amendment [original remains current]
AmendedVersionSigned --> AmendmentDraft : request another correction [reason supplied]
note right of Signed
  Signed versions are immutable. An amendment creates a linked
  successor version; it never overwrites the signed source.
end note
Signed --> [*]
@enduml